  "solution": {
    "text": "For string fixed at both the ends, resonant frequency are given by<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Where symbols have their meaning. It is given that 315 Hz and 420 Hz are two consecutive resonant frequency, let these nth and (n+1)th harmonics.<br /><br /><math><mn>315</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mn>420</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />⟹Eq.(i)÷Eq.(ii)<br /><br /><math><mo>⟹</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>315</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>450</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⟹</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br />From Eq. (i), lowest resonant frequency<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>315</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>105</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math>",
